notes:
THE BUG (lines 101, 150 in leaderboard.ts):
```typescript
// WRONG - assumes email === visitorId
const streak = await calculateCurrentStreak(ctx, user.email);
const visitorId = user.email;  // This is the bug!
```

THE FIX:
```typescript
// CORRECT - use authId to look up user's data
const authId = user.authId;  // User's Better Auth ID
const streak = await calculateCurrentStreak(ctx, authId);
```

The users table has authId field linking to Better Auth. Use that to find user's data in other tables (which now have userId field).
